OpenAI Codex Responses provider adapted from @howaboua/pi-codex-conversion
at 5dc8fa4bbded063f9c158e2af7a8a53eeaea7fbb.
Source: https://github.com/IgorWarzocha/howaboua-pi-stuff
Modifications: standalone pi-ai Provider for Durable hosts, instance-owned
transport lifecycle, native Node transport and image preparation.
The Pi extension, TUI and session-manager adapters are not included.
Selected protocol refreshes from snapshot 69f50cf70e8a7b05c2349be6227f521b6504f80e:
SSE opening retry budget from 5a109ed787b2a2e947f262be21f610ed3b732c4f;
partial_answer signatures and replay from b7d92bd90aa5fa6b25b18080a88539aab54254b5.
Daybreak account-catalog discovery and Ultrafast pricing adapted from PR491,
snapshot 88c08f52bbf05be17525ec47a6f1d9958f07fdab, PR head 2a24e1d3.
Modifications: provider-instance bounded identity cache, Web Crypto identity
digest for Node and Workers, explicit opt-in settings, and final-body pricing.
Pi configuration, UI and native compaction integration are not included.
Selected provider refreshes from snapshot 036dc876da5afc4ec27b64878ebb1cfb30c8211d:
interrupted tool-stream recovery (9a669ac0, c337c9a8), strict final tool arguments
and model-switch thinking removal (1985f069), advisory Codex routing (1fd72ce4)
and WebSocket timing-metric requests (93895b22), plus the GPT-6.1 Sol context
window correction (1fd63f8e).
Modifications: routing hints are bounded and Codex-only; explicit no-fallback
policy is preserved. Pi diagnostics logging and integration are not included.

Selected provider refreshes from exact snapshot
7f3295e67a8e6146b2a6922b56a06fa4db5c3a32, including its local commits:
bounded fresh WebSocket retries and independent SSE recovery, raw socket errors,
bounded continuation diagnostics and socket request ordinals, gateway-first
request serialisation, explicit routing affinity and developer-input instructions.
Modifications: instance-owned recovery and cancellation; speculative handshake
failures count against retry admission; terminal observer failures never replay;
case-insensitive request affinity reconnects without merging native socket lanes.
Pi usage ledgers, UI, V2 session compaction and experimental GPT prompt-policy
brokers are excluded. Durable owns native session identity and lifecycle.
Pi 1.4 additions-only transcript folding and native-session diagnostic selection
follow snapshot 3d0faf5a6f0bc67c0bd9248d07da6ddfa901b281.
Modifications: transport cleanup remains provider-instance owned. No Pi-global
session cleanup callback, footer or logging adapter is installed.

Opt-in generated-current keepalive scheduling and current transport selection
follow snapshot 12c4357b2c401fe9be8c6c82d2ae252c0f986937, including d08c31c9.
Source owners: adapter/activation/cache-keepalive.ts and extension/runtime.ts.
Modifications: explicit host-prepared snapshot and currentness callbacks,
session-scoped provider-owned scheduling, cancellation and usage reporting.
No Pi idle hooks, configuration UI, global paths or automatic adoption.

